<<<
Originally, computers were invented to support cognitive processes with the goal of "intelligence amplification." However, intelligence can be applied narrowly and blindly, making it more advantageous to focus on amplifying awareness instead.
<<< //Permacomputing as a Practice for Digital Graphic Design//

Quoted in [[Amplify Awareness]]. See also [[Permacomputing]].
